There is **1 admin** currently in the platform.

<CONTEXT>
User requested counts of agents and admins in the platform. Used aggregation_reporting class with generate_aggregation_report function: metric "count", filter type "AGENT" returned 1,498 agents; filter type "ADMIN" returned 1 admin. System workflow: read(category) → execute function with JSON payload → return result. Aggregation reporting supports count metrics with type filters (AGENT, ADMIN, USER, etc.).{{READ:category}}
